# headwear/helm/kettle: the Kettle helm (polish i1, LADDER-HEAD, gen_kettle.py; helmForm 2 = cult::HelmForm::Kettle):
# a low round steel crown, a lit band (R) and a wide brim at the brow row whose underside is metal 1, never the outline
# step, so the eyes under it read as eyes (the nasal's goggle lesson). Open face. Hair above the brim hidden.
# Highland (`furtrim`): a fur band round the crown and a feather (plume slot). Marsh (`tassels`, replace): the brim wider
# and drooping like a reed hat, a cloth wrap (accent) round the crown, cord tassels at the brim's ends.
# Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role helm form2
role helm fam.kettle
layer headwear
anchor head
keys rest
tags overlay
legend Q plume 0
legend R plume 1
legend S plume 2
legend T plume 3
legend U plume 4
legend H leather 1

view D key rest origin 2 1
mark crown 9 3
|--------------------
|--------------------
|--------------------
|-------vvvvvv-------
|-----vvzyyyxxvv-----
|----vzyyyyxxxxwv----
|----vyyyyxxxxxwv----
|---vyyyyyyxxxxwwv---
|.vzyyyyyyyyxxxxxxwv.
|..vwxxxwwwwwwwwwwv..
