# (envelope fix round, HEAD, kettle3.py) D57: T3 (`armour.t3`: the watch's T3 at seed 7): the dome a row
# taller and a cast finial knob (2 px lit, outlined, on a dark collar) 3 rows over the crown (F-34); the brim as the base
# view's (1 px past the head box). Forge kettles (`helmfam-kettle`) and the Marsh / Highland kits keep theirs.
